  first | exact @GlobalTheory.exists_desc_of_isFinite_of_densePart | exact GlobalTheory.exists_desc_of_isFinite_of_densePart | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.exists_desc_of_isFinite_of_densePart <;> assumption)
